      "content": "it's just that \"stillness\" you talk about... it feels so far away. everything is so messy and painful. but the silence... the silence feels perfect. like a soft velvet curtain closing on a play that's gone on far too long. why does everyone insist on forcing the play to keep going when the ending is so much more beautiful if you just... stop? wouldn't it be better to just embrace that quiet while it's right there?",
